2735
01:52:09,100 --> 01:52:09,633
Para pahlawan,

2736
01:52:09,900 --> 01:52:10,533
siyap-siyap nyerang!

2737
01:52:19,800 --> 01:52:20,233
Ah ora, mlayu nganggo geni

2738
01:52:31,500 --> 01:52:32,200
!

2739
01:52:32,633 --> 01:52:34,266
Wong-wong mau mlayu, pancen mlayu tenan!  Wong

2740
01:52:34,433 --> 01:52:35,566
Mang Lor lagi mlayu

2741
01:52:42,800 --> 01:52:43,033
,

2742
01:52:43,266 --> 01:52:43,900
siap-siap nyerang!

2743
01:52:53,266 --> 01:52:56,433
Tuan enom, tanpa panjenengan ing perang iki dina iki,

2744
01:52:56,566 --> 01:52:57,900
Kutha Yangguan mesthi wis kalah.

2745
01:52:58,100 --> 01:53:00,033
Mangkok iki minangka roti panggangku kanggo kowe.

2746
01:53:02,033 --> 01:53:04,366
Pak Shen, bali ing tembok kutha, panjenengan rawuh kasep

2747
01:53:04,400 --> 01:53:05,566
lan kula nyebut panjenengan penipu.

2748
01:53:05,600 --> 01:53:06,233
Yen ora amarga kowé,

2749
01:53:06,266 --> 01:53:08,366
aku mesthi wis dipenggal sirahku karo anak buahé Huyan Shuo saiki.

2750
01:53:08,400 --> 01:53:10,166
Mangkuk anggur iki minangka pangapuraku marang kowe.  Tangia

2751
01:53:10,533 --> 01:53:11,366
.

2752
01:53:12,600 --> 01:53:14,333
Aku ora duwe hubungan karo pangeranmu.  Wajar wae yen

2753
01:53:14,700 --> 01:53:15,766
kowe curiga karo aku.

2754
01:53:16,233 --> 01:53:17,200
Nanging liya wektu, aja ndhingkluk.

2755
01:53:17,433 --> 01:53:18,033
Aku ora biasa.

2756
01:53:18,266 --> 01:53:20,233
Sanajan Pangeran Kapisan wis ngarah menyang Kutha Yangguan

2757
01:53:20,266 --> 01:53:21,666
nggunakake pedhang Mang Lor kanggo mateni aku,

2758
01:53:21,700 --> 01:53:23,100
dheweke ora bakal ndemek aku kanthi terang-terangan.

2759
01:53:23,133 --> 01:53:24,366
Sawise kabeh, kita menang perang iki.

2760
01:53:24,433 --> 01:53:25,866
Baginda duwe jasa militer sing kudu dilindhungi kanggo kita.

2761
01:53:26,033 --> 01:53:27,333
Nanging anggere aku isih urip,

2762
01:53:27,600 --> 01:53:28,600
dheweke ora bakal mandheg.

2763
01:53:29,100 --> 01:53:30,866
Sakbanjure, aku kudu bali menyang
ibukutha kanggo nglaporake tugasku.

2764
01:53:30,966 --> 01:53:33,100
Kapisan, kanggo ngirim laporan perang
babagan serangan tapel wates Mang Lor.

2765
01:53:35,700 --> 01:53:37,666
Ibukuthane cukup adoh, ta?

2766
01:53:38,066 --> 01:53:38,900
Setengah sasi numpak jaran

2767
01:53:39,233 --> 01:53:40,533
Sepuluh dina kanthi kecepatan penuh

2768
01:53:41,900 --> 01:53:43,033
Masalahnya, yen aku bali menyang ibukutha,

2769
01:53:43,133 --> 01:53:44,100
aku bisa uga ora bisa bali menyang Kutha Yangguan.

2770
01:53:44,133 --> 01:53:45,733
Pangeran Kapisan wis mbangun
kakuwatane ing ibukutha sajrone pirang-pirang taun.

2771
01:53:45,766 --> 01:53:46,433
Sawise aku bali wektu iki,

2772
01:53:46,466 --> 01:53:47,366
dheweke mesthi bakal nindakake kabeh sing bisa ditindakake

2773
01:53:47,400 --> 01:53:48,233
supaya aku tetep ana ing ibukutha.

2774
01:53:49,966 --> 01:53:50,700
Tuan enom,

2775
01:53:51,433 --> 01:53:53,333
Panjenengan nylametake kabeh wong ing Kutha Yangguan dina iki

2776
01:53:53,466 --> 01:53:54,500
lan panjenengan uga nylametake nyawaku.

2777
01:53:54,566 --> 01:53:55,566
Jabatan resmi apa sing panjenengan karepake,

2778
01:53:55,900 --> 01:53:57,066
emas, perak, utawa tanah?

2779
01:53:57,533 --> 01:53:59,033
Anggere iku sing bisa daktawakake, Yuan Ye,

2780
01:53:59,200 --> 01:53:59,933
sebutna wae.

2781
01:54:00,733 --> 01:54:01,833
Amarga Paduka ingkang Maha Agung sampun ngendika makaten,

2782
01:54:02,033 --> 01:54:03,266
mila kawula boten badhe ngadeg wonten ing upacara.

2783
01:54:13,433 --> 01:54:14,166
Ya wis,

2784
01:54:14,533 --> 01:54:15,266
aku ana ing kene,

2785
01:54:15,833 --> 01:54:16,566
Tuan Muda,

2786
01:54:17,333 --> 01:54:19,200
kowe wis nylametake kabeh wong ing Kutha Yangguan dina iki,

2787
01:54:19,500 --> 01:54:20,300
lan kowe uga nylametake nyawaku.

2788
01:54:20,800 --> 01:54:21,466
Apa sing kokkarepake?  Sebutna wae jenenge

2789
01:54:21,500 --> 01:54:22,600
.

2790
01:54:23,466 --> 01:54:24,533
Amarga Paduka Sang Prabu ngandika mangkono, mila kawula

2791
01:54:24,866 --> 01:54:26,000
boten badhe nahan-nahan.  Ya wis

2792
01:54:30,800 --> 01:54:32,766
, aku nrima.

2793
01:54:44,733 --> 01:54:46,266
Sajrone wektu iki, aku wis merenovasi gubug jerami iki

2794
01:54:46,300 --> 01:54:47,333
saka ndhuwur nganti ngisor, njero lan njaba.

2795
01:54:47,866 --> 01:54:49,466
Pungkasane, kita bisa urip kanthi apik ing kene.

2796
01:54:49,700 --> 01:54:51,833
Sawise mbuwang artefak Huyan Shuo menyang papan kasebut,

2797
01:54:51,866 --> 01:54:53,800
kultivasiku langsung didorong menyang Alam Bawaan.

2798
01:54:53,833 --> 01:54:54,833
Ditambah pengalaman tempur sing tak entuk

2799
01:54:54,866 --> 01:54:56,666
nalika Wenren Yiyi mbantu aku nguji bedhil,

2800
01:54:56,700 --> 01:54:58,833
lan saiki aku bisa nglindhungi awake dhewe ing jagad iki.

2801
01:54:58,866 --> 01:54:59,433
Nanging,

2802
01:54:59,733 --> 01:55:00,966
barang-barang iki ing jagad kultivasi

2803
01:55:01,000 --> 01:55:02,300
minangka barang langka sing unik.

2804
01:55:02,800 --> 01:55:03,666
Nanging ing Kutha Yangguan,

2805
01:55:04,000 --> 01:55:05,433
barang langka wae ora bakal entuk rega sing apik.

2806
01:55:06,000 --> 01:55:07,133
Wong-wong ing kene wis mlarat banget.

2807
01:55:07,833 --> 01:55:09,100
Aku luwih becik menyang kutha gedhe wae.

2808
01:55:09,866 --> 01:55:10,800
Panggonan sing luwih akeh wong sugih,

2809
01:55:11,066 --> 01:55:11,666
luwih akeh petani,

2810
01:55:12,033 --> 01:55:13,133
lan luwih akeh wong sing ngerti barang-barang sing berkualitas.

2811
01:55:13,633 --> 01:55:14,300
Kaya kutha krajan.

2812
01:55:19,133 --> 01:55:20,433
Perintah kekaisaran wis teka. Wis tekan.

2813
01:55:25,366 --> 01:55:26,133
Dadi wis tekan iki.

2814
01:55:26,800 --> 01:55:27,466
Sawise pirang-pirang taun,

2815
01:55:27,733 --> 01:55:29,100
pungkasane dheweke teka.

2816
01:55:35,400 --> 01:55:37,200
Kanthi sih-rahmat saka Swarga, Kaisar ndhawuhi

2817
01:55:40,166 --> 01:55:42,100
Song Yi, mantan Direktur
Biro Medis Kekaisaran ing Pangkat 4a.

2818
01:55:42,366 --> 01:55:43,200
Kanthi katrampilan medis sing luar biasa

2819
01:55:43,466 --> 01:55:44,266
lan kesetiaan sing ora goyah.

2820
01:55:44,500 --> 01:55:45,666
Saiki sampeyan wis dibalekake menyang jabatan sadurunge

2821
01:55:45,800 --> 01:55:47,866
minangka Direktur Biro Medis Kekaisaran, Pangkat 4a.

2822
01:55:48,233 --> 01:55:49,800
Kulawarga Song wis dibalekake kanthi lengkap
menyang status sadurunge.

2823
01:55:50,033 --> 01:55:51,266
Lan omah leluhure ing ibukutha dibalekake.

2824
01:55:51,700 --> 01:55:53,033
Kajaba iku, wenehake sewu tael emas

2825
01:55:53,466 --> 01:55:54,166
lan satus gulung sutra alus.

2826
01:55:54,666 --> 01:55:57,200
Prentahake Song Yi supaya nggawa keluargane menyang
ibukutha kanggo ketemu langsung.

2827
01:55:58,033 --> 01:55:58,466
Miturut dekrit kekaisaran

2828
01:56:07,166 --> 01:56:09,100
Ora nyana Pangeran Katelu obah kanthi cepet banget.

2829
01:56:10,833 --> 01:56:11,333
Wong tuwa,

2830
01:56:12,166 --> 01:56:12,833
kemasi barang-barangmu,

2831
01:56:13,400 --> 01:56:14,266
kita arep menyang ibukutha.